Electron adaptation notes (43-x-y):
This branch's MediaElementAudioSourceHandler predates several upstream refactors (it still used a MediaElementAudioSourceHandlerLocker helper, had no OnCurrentSrcChanged() on the handler, no *ForTesting hooks, and built the resampler with RenderQuantumFrames() directly). The handler .cc/.h were rewritten to upstream's post-fix shape: the CrossThreadWeakPersistent<HTMLMediaElement> is replaced by a scoped_refptr<WebAudioSourceProviderImpl> guarded by process_lock_, obtained from WebMediaPlayer::GetAudioSourceProvider() (already available on this branch), with the new ProvideInput()/GetMediaElement()/Dispose() logic. The branch's resampler construction was kept, and the unused OnCurrentSrcChanged()/testing hooks were not added. The media_element_audio_source_node_test.cc and web_audio_source_provider_impl_test.cc hunks were dropped (test-only); web_audio_source_provider_impl.cc applied unchanged.

